<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-C</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Results</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In V-C Results ‣ V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Quantitative results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In V-C Results ‣ V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Qualitative results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In V-C Results ‣ V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Comparison to retraining.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In V-C Results ‣ V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablation insights.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In V EXPERIMENTS ‣ FlowCorrect: Efficient Interactive Correction of Generative Flow Policies for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Discussion and Outlook.</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
